WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:41.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.000 --> 01:43.240
Hello.

3
01:56.120 --> 01:57.160
What are you doing here?

4
01:58.080 --> 02:00.480
I came to see my uncle. We have something to discuss.

5
02:05.360 --> 02:06.720
Just kidding.

6
02:06.800 --> 02:08.600
I'm here for a dermatology appointment.

7
02:08.680 --> 02:10.280
It's all Zhang Qi's fault.

8
02:10.360 --> 02:12.760
To save time, he just got water from some random place.

9
02:12.840 --> 02:14.960
Look. I've got a rash on my neck.

10
02:16.000 --> 02:18.520
Come to think of it, I have you to thank for that.

11
02:20.160 --> 02:22.320
I thought the rules of the game were perfectly clear.

12
02:28.200 --> 02:29.880
But I always thought

13
02:30.520 --> 02:31.840
that it was just the two of us

14
02:33.240 --> 02:34.280
in this game.

15
02:56.080 --> 02:58.400
A WHITE COAT, A PURE HEART, ENTIRELY DEVOTED TO THE PATIENT

16
02:58.480 --> 03:00.600
What's wrong? Did something happen with your mom?

17
03:01.360 --> 03:02.280
No.

18
03:02.360 --> 03:03.720
I just wanted to ask.

19
03:03.800 --> 03:07.280
The Compassionate Care Bed program needs patient information submitted each year.

20
03:07.360 --> 03:09.120
Why haven't we heard anything this year?

21
03:09.200 --> 03:10.360
Compassionate Care Bed?

22
03:10.440 --> 03:11.720
Just a moment.

23
03:13.600 --> 03:15.040
It's not time to submit it yet.

24
03:15.880 --> 03:17.800
-When do we submit it then? -Next month.

25
03:17.880 --> 03:19.600
Don't worry. I'll be sure to remind you.

26
03:23.520 --> 03:26.000
CORE INTRODUCTION TO REHABILITATION THERAPY

27
03:32.040 --> 03:35.040
DOCTOR TEAM XIE LIMING

28
03:38.800 --> 03:40.440
XIAOCHEN

29
03:40.520 --> 03:43.240
Xiaozheng came by shortly after you left.

30
03:43.320 --> 03:45.040
Didn't you run into her?

31
03:49.240 --> 03:50.160
No.

32
03:51.520 --> 03:53.200
I gave her the drink.

33
03:53.280 --> 03:55.120
She didn't suspect a thing.

34
03:57.720 --> 03:58.960
Let's keep it a secret.

35
04:02.400 --> 04:03.360
Xiaozheng.

36
04:04.200 --> 04:06.240
Someone came looking for you while you were away.

37
04:07.440 --> 04:09.040
-Who? -Take a guess.

38
04:10.720 --> 04:12.200
I have no idea.

39
04:12.280 --> 04:13.520
Okay, I'll tell you.

40
04:14.120 --> 04:16.959
Your brother. Xiaomian.

41
04:17.040 --> 04:18.880
He came by before the semester started.

42
04:18.959 --> 04:21.279
The day you went to the beach.

43
04:23.320 --> 04:24.200
What did he come for?

44
04:24.800 --> 04:27.640
He took the study list for the College Entrance Exam

45
04:27.720 --> 04:29.840
you left for him in your drawer.

46
04:31.480 --> 04:35.200
I only made that list while preparing lessons for a student I tutor.

47
04:35.280 --> 04:36.480
I just wrote one for him too.

48
04:54.000 --> 04:56.000
OUTPATIENT MEDICAL RECORD NAME: CHEN YANZHOU

49
04:56.600 --> 04:58.880
JI HENG HOSPITAL OF QINGYI CITY COMPLETE BLOOD COUNT

50
05:07.160 --> 05:09.640
FRONTIERS IN PLANT SCIENCE

51
05:11.840 --> 05:15.320
Your article really got published in this magazine.

52
05:16.480 --> 05:18.920
I didn't expect much when I submitted it.

53
05:19.640 --> 05:21.440
I never thought they'd actually accept it.

54
05:25.720 --> 05:28.720
Is this what you were talking about last time?

55
05:28.800 --> 05:30.400
HIGH SCHOOL ENTRANCE EXAM MOCK TEST (1)

56
05:30.480 --> 05:32.040
TOPIC 4: PEACEFUL GLOBAL DEVELOPMENT

57
05:43.040 --> 05:44.520
What's so interesting about this?

58
05:45.400 --> 05:46.800
If you want to read something,

59
05:46.880 --> 05:48.960
it should at least be an article published in a journal.

60
05:52.160 --> 05:55.040
How would I understand your technical articles?

61
06:04.600 --> 06:05.600
Xie Yudi.

62
06:05.680 --> 06:08.680
If I were you, I'd ask Zheng Yu for compensation.

63
06:09.960 --> 06:11.600
How could I make her pay?

64
06:12.400 --> 06:15.040
Besides, what could she possibly pay me with?

65
06:21.640 --> 06:23.840
-Let me ask you something. -Go ahead.

66
06:25.240 --> 06:26.440
Have a seat.

67
06:27.120 --> 06:29.720
So I have this friend.

68
06:30.360 --> 06:33.160
In his freshman year, he met a girl.

69
06:34.360 --> 06:36.760
The girl has a mom in a vegetative state.

70
06:37.360 --> 06:40.880
My friend saw how tough things were for her,

71
06:40.960 --> 06:42.240
so he referred her to a hospital.

72
06:43.360 --> 06:46.200
None of their classmates knew that the girl's mom was in a vegetative state.

73
06:48.160 --> 06:49.800
My friend…

74
06:49.880 --> 06:51.040
He liked her.

75
06:52.000 --> 06:54.080
So he decided to keep it a secret for her.

76
06:54.160 --> 06:55.400
Later,

77
06:56.240 --> 06:57.960
he wanted to visit her mom,

78
06:58.640 --> 07:00.560
but the girl wouldn't let him into the room.

79
07:01.480 --> 07:02.600
They even had a huge argument.

80
07:03.760 --> 07:04.880
Why?

81
07:04.960 --> 07:06.680
The girl's reason was that

82
07:08.480 --> 07:10.640
she didn't want anyone invading her privacy.

83
07:10.720 --> 07:12.240
She said that her mom was her bottom line.

84
07:12.320 --> 07:14.800
Anyway, I don't remember the details anymore.

85
07:16.360 --> 07:17.920
But basically,

86
07:18.760 --> 07:21.600
she wouldn't let him visit her mom or help her in any way.

87
07:23.080 --> 07:27.680
My friend realized she was being quite paranoid about it all,

88
07:27.760 --> 07:28.880
so he didn't dare go back.

89
07:29.880 --> 07:30.800
You…

90
07:30.880 --> 07:33.800
I didn't know your friend could be such a coward.

91
07:36.120 --> 07:37.200
But today,

92
07:38.360 --> 07:40.560
he saw another guy

93
07:40.640 --> 07:42.760
taking care of her mom in the hospital room.

94
07:43.640 --> 07:45.520
And it didn't seem like his first time either.

95
07:46.680 --> 07:47.840
A backup option.

96
07:48.960 --> 07:49.880
You mean that guy?

97
07:49.960 --> 07:52.480
With you… I mean, your friend.

98
07:53.600 --> 07:55.040
With your friend,

99
07:55.120 --> 07:57.960
she acts all noble and righteous.

100
07:58.040 --> 08:01.600
Money and favors can't sway her.

101
08:01.680 --> 08:04.640
That makes your friend think that she's independent and strong,

102
08:04.720 --> 08:06.440
which only makes him love her more.

103
08:07.040 --> 08:09.000
But with the other guy,

104
08:09.080 --> 08:11.240
she acts like she can't do anything herself.

105
08:11.320 --> 08:12.960
She depends on him for everything,

106
08:13.040 --> 08:16.640
making him feel needed and like he's some kind of hero.

107
08:18.160 --> 08:21.040
This girl sure knows how to play both sides.

108
08:31.360 --> 08:33.679
Hey! Everyone, I have an announcement.

109
08:34.640 --> 08:37.679
In line with our college's annual tradition,

110
08:37.760 --> 08:39.679
after the Field Practice Report is done,

111
08:39.760 --> 08:42.159
we'll hold a specimen exhibition open to the whole university

112
08:42.240 --> 08:45.760
to showcase the specimens you collected.

113
08:45.840 --> 08:48.400
We'll also team up with the university's Charity Club

114
08:48.480 --> 08:50.400
to hold a charity bazaar.

115
08:50.480 --> 08:53.080
As for the specific date, location, and requirements,

116
08:53.160 --> 08:55.320
I will post that info in the group chat later today.

117
08:55.400 --> 08:57.760
I hope everyone will participate and help spread the word.

118
08:57.840 --> 09:00.320
Let's aim to raise more than last year's total!

119
09:00.400 --> 09:02.320
-All right? -All right!

120
09:02.400 --> 09:03.440
Okay.

121
09:03.520 --> 09:05.040
How much did they raise last year?

122
09:05.120 --> 09:07.480
I don't know, but I heard it was a big hit.

123
09:07.560 --> 09:08.840
I even went to check it out.

124
09:08.920 --> 09:09.800
Really?

125
09:09.880 --> 09:10.720
Let's check it out.

126
09:10.800 --> 09:12.640
You go ahead. I'll pass.

127
09:12.720 --> 09:13.760
Then how do I sign up?

128
09:13.840 --> 09:15.000
How would I know?

129
09:26.840 --> 09:28.360
When we first started freshman year,

130
09:30.000 --> 09:32.360
Zheng Yu used her mom's condition to make me feel sorry for her.

131
09:34.240 --> 09:36.360
She got tens of thousands from me,

132
09:37.200 --> 09:39.240
then dumped me as soon as she'd spent it.

133
09:39.320 --> 09:42.440
She wouldn't even let me visit her mom.

134
09:44.160 --> 09:46.480
Then why did you go to the hospital that day?

135
09:48.680 --> 09:50.960
I just wanted to see which sucker…

136
09:52.720 --> 09:54.040
was taking care of her mom for her.

137
10:03.960 --> 10:05.000
Be careful.

138
10:05.600 --> 10:07.400
I'm just warning you

139
10:07.480 --> 10:09.280
not to make the same mistake I did

140
10:09.840 --> 10:11.360
of becoming someone else's ATM.

141
10:14.480 --> 10:15.680
That money you mentioned.

142
10:16.640 --> 10:17.720
Did she pay you back?

143
10:21.640 --> 10:22.560
Why?

144
10:23.760 --> 10:25.160
Are you planning to pay it back for her?

145
10:27.520 --> 10:30.160
I shouldn't waste this golden opportunity to be her ATM, right?

146
10:36.640 --> 10:38.320
Looks like she's already paid it all back.

147
10:39.440 --> 10:40.520
What a shame.

148
10:41.160 --> 10:42.400
Who says she's paid it all back?

149
10:49.520 --> 10:53.080
Then make sure you calculate it carefully and send me the exact amount.

150
10:54.520 --> 10:56.400
Oh, right.

151
10:57.000 --> 10:58.440
We haven't added each other on WeChat.

152
11:01.880 --> 11:02.920
Scan me.

153
11:14.840 --> 11:16.040
Are you two dating?

154
11:21.400 --> 11:23.800
Is dating the only kind of relationship there is?

155
11:25.480 --> 11:30.000
Do you think trust and support can only exist in a romantic relationship?

156
11:31.560 --> 11:33.040
The way you ask that

157
11:33.120 --> 11:34.520
almost makes me feel sorry for you.

158
12:05.240 --> 12:06.400
What a nightmare.

159
12:06.480 --> 12:09.680
I've been in the hospital so long that weeds are probably growing at home.

160
12:09.760 --> 12:12.200
At least the weeds haven't grown over your grave.

161
12:12.280 --> 12:14.160
Just try drinking yourself into that state again!

162
12:15.640 --> 12:17.320
-Take that. -Someone's here. Stop talking.

163
12:17.400 --> 12:19.240
What's wrong with scolding you a bit?

164
13:04.480 --> 13:05.680
Whose pajamas are these?

165
13:05.760 --> 13:07.520
They've been in the washer all night.

166
13:07.600 --> 13:10.680
Can you take them out once they're done? Other people need to do their laundry too.

167
13:11.360 --> 13:14.080
Wait a second. I think they're my roommate's.

168
13:23.040 --> 13:23.880
Zhuang Ning.

169
13:24.400 --> 13:26.240
You left your clothes in the laundry room.

170
13:28.800 --> 13:29.920
Zhuang Ning?

171
14:15.800 --> 14:18.800
XIE YUDI

172
14:56.880 --> 14:58.600
I'm taking attendance at random.

173
15:00.680 --> 15:02.360
-Feng Yuting. -Here.

174
15:03.440 --> 15:04.840
-Zhang Qi. -Here.

175
15:06.760 --> 15:08.560
-Liu Linlin. -Here.

176
15:09.400 --> 15:10.240
Zhuang Ning.

177
15:14.000 --> 15:15.640
Is Zhuang Ning here?

178
15:15.720 --> 15:17.240
She went to the restroom, ma'am.

179
15:17.840 --> 15:19.760
-Her things are still here. -Yes.

180
15:21.880 --> 15:22.880
Guo Xiao.

181
15:24.360 --> 15:25.360
Guo Xiao.

182
15:26.000 --> 15:28.720
The semester has only just started, and you're already skipping class?

183
15:35.720 --> 15:36.640
Are you okay?

184
15:49.240 --> 15:51.320
Xie Yudi called you last night.

185
15:51.400 --> 15:52.360
I answered.

186
15:54.160 --> 15:55.040
Why?

187
15:55.800 --> 15:57.640
Didn't you tell me before

188
15:57.720 --> 15:59.640
that you hated it when I told him anything about you?

189
16:00.560 --> 16:02.320
If so, you should stay away from me.

190
16:02.400 --> 16:04.040
Don't touch my things,

191
16:04.120 --> 16:05.400
and don't answer my calls.

192
16:07.760 --> 16:09.240
Are you in elementary school?

193
16:12.600 --> 16:14.080
What I mean is,

194
16:14.160 --> 16:16.960
you can't solve everything by drawing a hard line.

195
16:18.360 --> 16:22.600
If you're avoiding me because you're afraid of getting me into trouble,

196
16:23.640 --> 16:24.960
you don't have to.

197
16:29.160 --> 16:30.960
Then how am I supposed to deal with this?

198
16:35.200 --> 16:37.800
First, tell me why you're so afraid of Xie Yudi.

199
16:42.320 --> 16:43.840
Is it because of…

200
16:45.040 --> 16:46.160
This?

201
16:52.120 --> 16:53.600
When I answered the call last night,

202
16:53.680 --> 16:56.400
I suddenly remembered you'd told me

203
16:56.480 --> 16:58.600
that you and Xie Yudi were high school classmates.

204
16:59.200 --> 17:01.160
So I searched your name online.

205
17:01.240 --> 17:02.920
HOMETOWN ASSOCIATION REGISTRATION FORM

206
17:04.359 --> 17:07.040
ZHUANG NING

207
17:07.119 --> 17:09.319
XIE YUDI

208
17:10.680 --> 17:13.520
Recently, false rumors have spread around school that Xie bullied Zhuang.

209
17:13.599 --> 17:17.440
I came across your school notice. It said you both had a dispute.

210
17:17.520 --> 17:21.480
At around 4:00 p.m., March 20, a dispute arose between Xie and Zhuang

211
17:21.560 --> 17:24.720
because Xie splashed paint and stained Zhuang's clothes.

212
17:24.800 --> 17:26.520
Other students witnessed the incident.

213
17:26.599 --> 17:28.960
During the confrontation, the two pushed each other.

214
17:29.040 --> 17:31.120
Zhuang then accidentally fell down the stairs,

215
17:31.200 --> 17:32.480
fracturing her collarbone.

216
17:32.560 --> 17:35.960
Xie has since shown remorse and paid the medical expenses.

217
17:36.040 --> 17:37.640
Both parties have reached a settlement.

218
17:37.720 --> 17:40.120
Zhuang Ning, why is your collarbone sitting so high?

219
17:45.760 --> 17:48.600
Can you tell me now what happened between you and Xie Yudi?

220
17:50.160 --> 17:53.560
How did I never notice before how nosy you are?

221
17:55.920 --> 17:58.680
Anyway, I'll graduate in a year.

222
17:58.760 --> 18:01.680
After that, we'll never cross paths again.

223
18:01.760 --> 18:02.840
It'll all be over.

224
18:05.120 --> 18:06.320
Is a year that short?

225
18:08.600 --> 18:12.040
For people who go through life without much trouble,

226
18:12.120 --> 18:13.440
I guess it is.

227
18:14.200 --> 18:16.680
But for those who have to force themselves through each day

228
18:16.760 --> 18:18.560
just to keep going,

229
18:19.600 --> 18:20.960
even a single day

230
18:21.720 --> 18:22.960
can feel endless.

231
18:37.080 --> 18:38.280
Do you really want to hear it?

232
18:45.280 --> 18:46.680
Honestly,

233
18:47.280 --> 18:51.920
I don't even know what started all of this in the first place.

234
18:52.800 --> 18:55.720
I think it all changed starting that day.

235
18:55.800 --> 18:56.680
Xie Yudi.

236
18:56.760 --> 18:58.920
Have you turned in your Chinese homework yet?

237
18:59.000 --> 19:01.760
I did, class rep. You must've missed it.

238
19:08.040 --> 19:08.880
Yours isn't here.

239
19:14.880 --> 19:16.280
Then I must've forgotten to do it.

240
19:16.880 --> 19:18.480
Can't you let it slide this time?

241
19:24.040 --> 19:26.720
Mr. Li said to write down the names of anyone who didn't do it.

242
19:26.800 --> 19:30.360
I'll write down your name first, then I'll explain it to Mr. Li for you.

243
19:30.920 --> 19:32.160
XIE YUDI

244
19:32.240 --> 19:34.720
Zhang Wei. Where's your Chinese homework?

245
19:39.440 --> 19:41.440
SCHOOL: HENGJIANG HIGH SCHOOL NAME: ZHANG WEI

246
19:45.600 --> 19:47.480
NAME: XIE YUDI

247
19:55.720 --> 19:57.920
Then please change the name for me.

248
19:59.080 --> 20:00.240
Thank you.

249
20:02.720 --> 20:05.960
After that day, they seemed to be everywhere.

250
20:06.040 --> 20:07.280
Really?

251
20:07.360 --> 20:09.960
It seemed like they weren't doing anything,

252
20:10.640 --> 20:13.080
but it was still unbearable.

253
20:15.600 --> 20:18.520
Xie Yudi was popular in our class.

254
20:18.600 --> 20:21.000
Whatever he did, others followed suit.

255
20:21.880 --> 20:24.280
And their numbers kept growing.

256
20:26.120 --> 20:30.160
At first, it was just a few unexplainable glances.

257
20:31.200 --> 20:32.040
Gradually…

258
20:32.120 --> 20:32.960
Hey, look at her.

259
20:33.040 --> 20:35.400
It turned into little jokes and snide remarks.

260
20:35.480 --> 20:38.080
Zhuang Ning, did you just come back from the restroom?

261
20:41.880 --> 20:42.960
Besides me,

262
20:44.080 --> 20:45.280
nobody else cared.

263
20:45.920 --> 20:49.560
Everyone thought it was just jokes between classmates.

264
20:50.640 --> 20:54.200
But those so-called jokes kept testing my limits.

265
20:54.280 --> 20:56.000
And they kept getting worse.

266
21:10.400 --> 21:12.760
Class rep, sorry about that.

267
21:12.840 --> 21:14.840
My shoes are a little too big.

268
21:31.520 --> 21:32.520
That looks painful.

269
21:33.800 --> 21:34.800
Need any help?

270
21:36.680 --> 21:38.680
It's not like I never fought back.

271
21:39.400 --> 21:41.840
You said you found that notice online.

272
21:42.560 --> 21:43.600
It was that time.

273
21:44.800 --> 21:48.000
Xie Yudi's grades have always been good.

274
21:48.080 --> 21:51.840
I've never heard of him doing anything to bully his classmates.

275
21:52.440 --> 21:54.360
-Why are you accusing him? -It hurt so much that day.

276
21:54.960 --> 21:58.920
It felt like my whole body, from head to toe, inside and out,

277
21:59.000 --> 22:00.760
didn't have a single spot left unharmed.

278
22:01.720 --> 22:05.520
I told the teacher about it, but he didn't believe me.

279
22:06.920 --> 22:08.560
He even said I was overthinking it.

280
22:09.440 --> 22:11.600
Because he usually put up such a good façade,

281
22:11.680 --> 22:14.360
no one believed a model student would do something like that.

282
22:22.520 --> 22:25.600
I spent the whole night thinking about it.

283
22:26.320 --> 22:28.080
If it came down to it, we'd go down together.

284
22:29.120 --> 22:32.520
I even kept a utility knife in my pocket just in case.

285
22:33.880 --> 22:35.560
And guess what happened?

286
22:36.760 --> 22:39.240
He showed up at my family's breakfast shop.

287
22:40.400 --> 22:42.320
Xiaoning, your classmate is here to see you.

288
22:42.400 --> 22:44.080
He says you two are pretty close.

289
22:48.960 --> 22:49.840
Morning.

290
22:58.040 --> 22:59.520
Your parents told me

291
22:59.600 --> 23:01.560
you missed a step and fell down the stairs.

292
23:03.680 --> 23:04.800
Good.

293
23:05.600 --> 23:07.560
The better you behave, the less I'll come around.

294
23:13.720 --> 23:14.800
Take them.

295
23:20.880 --> 23:23.880
That was when I finally understood.

296
23:23.960 --> 23:25.920
Fighting back against him

297
23:26.480 --> 23:29.200
would take far more effort than enduring him.

298
23:30.960 --> 23:32.840
He could ruin my life,

299
23:33.920 --> 23:35.280
but not my parents'.

300
23:37.080 --> 23:40.440
Later, I watched a documentary.

301
23:40.520 --> 23:43.040
It showed barnacles that cling to whales in huge numbers,

302
23:44.120 --> 23:46.040
making it hard for them to swim,

303
23:46.120 --> 23:48.360
to breathe,

304
23:48.440 --> 23:50.360
even to make a sound,

305
23:50.440 --> 23:52.680
until they slowly sink into the deep sea.

306
23:53.280 --> 23:54.920
That's what he is to me.

307
23:56.280 --> 23:58.440
A barnacle clinging to my body.

308
23:59.440 --> 24:01.680
He won't kill me outright,

309
24:02.480 --> 24:03.480
but…

310
24:04.040 --> 24:07.160
I'll never be able to get away from him on my own.

311
24:10.280 --> 24:12.960
When the College Entrance Exam was over,

312
24:13.600 --> 24:16.480
I thought I'd finally be free of him.

313
24:17.760 --> 24:19.360
But I never expected

314
24:19.920 --> 24:23.680
that I'd end up at the same university as him,

315
24:23.760 --> 24:25.080
in the same major.

316
24:28.040 --> 24:29.560
After everything you've told me,

317
24:29.640 --> 24:33.880
you still think you can put an end to this after graduation?

318
24:37.280 --> 24:38.840
Have you ever considered…

319
24:44.320 --> 24:47.280
XU FANGLI

320
24:50.600 --> 24:53.280
You… should get back to class.

321
24:53.360 --> 24:56.480
If you get caught, you could lose your scholarship this semester.

322
25:06.160 --> 25:07.240
You have a fever.

323
25:07.320 --> 25:08.840
I'll take you to the infirmary. Let's go.

324
25:38.080 --> 25:39.080
You're still a little warm.

325
25:39.160 --> 25:40.760
Have something to eat.

326
25:42.640 --> 25:43.840
I…

327
25:43.920 --> 25:46.080
I don't really have an appetite. You eat.

328
25:47.000 --> 25:50.000
The doctor said you fainted because your blood sugar was low.

329
25:51.640 --> 25:52.960
Eat or don't. It's up to you.

330
25:54.120 --> 25:55.920
I'll lie down on the next bed.

331
26:32.320 --> 26:33.640
You should get back to class.

332
26:34.680 --> 26:36.520
They've already taken attendance.

333
26:36.600 --> 26:39.520
If your seat stays empty, they'll notice sooner or later.

334
26:40.840 --> 26:42.800
The university rules don't say

335
26:43.760 --> 26:45.320
that you have to ignore a friend in need

336
26:46.560 --> 26:48.080
just to keep your attendance up.

337
26:51.480 --> 26:52.320
A friend?

338
27:01.960 --> 27:02.920
Then…

339
27:03.000 --> 27:05.680
I'll message Linlin first

340
27:05.760 --> 27:07.800
and ask her to request sick leave for both of us.

341
27:08.560 --> 27:09.640
No, wait.

342
27:09.720 --> 27:11.640
I should call her instead.

343
27:11.720 --> 27:13.960
She probably isn't looking at her phone right now.

344
27:14.040 --> 27:16.560
CALL LOG, XIE YUDI

345
27:18.280 --> 27:19.360
You lied to me.

346
27:22.520 --> 27:25.000
You never answered Xie Yudi's call.

347
27:30.480 --> 27:31.360
Zheng Yu.

348
27:48.120 --> 27:50.640
You also keep putting up with Xie Yudi

349
27:51.240 --> 27:52.520
without saying a word.

350
27:53.320 --> 27:55.200
Why do you do that?

351
28:27.440 --> 28:28.400
It's raining.

352
28:36.920 --> 28:39.040
Aren't you going to take your bag and umbrella?

353
28:45.800 --> 28:46.880
Thank you.

354
28:49.200 --> 28:50.600
I wasn't sure if you'd forgotten them.

355
28:50.680 --> 28:52.400
I waited for you in class, but you never showed.

356
28:52.480 --> 28:53.640
So I brought them over.

357
28:53.720 --> 28:56.840
Why didn't you go inside? How long have you been waiting here?

358
28:58.480 --> 28:59.400
Not that long.

359
29:05.520 --> 29:06.560
Did something happen?

360
29:08.720 --> 29:09.760
Chen Yanzhou.

361
29:10.320 --> 29:12.760
I need your help with something.

362
29:12.840 --> 29:15.920
Do you have the contact info for the owner of the base where we did our fieldwork?

363
29:26.720 --> 29:29.880
SPECIMEN DETAILS

364
29:29.960 --> 29:31.720
PERFORMING ACTS OF CHARITY WITH SPECIMENS

365
29:31.800 --> 29:33.680
USING SPECIMENS TO SPREAD KINDNESS

366
29:33.760 --> 29:35.440
SPECIMEN CHARITY BAZAAR

367
29:36.080 --> 29:37.760
QING YI UNIVERSITY, CHARITY CLUB

368
29:43.280 --> 29:45.600
GET CLOSER TO NATURE, EXPLORE LIFE, SPREAD KINDNESS

369
29:50.280 --> 29:52.360
TURNING RESPECT FOR LIFE INTO GENTLE ACTION

370
29:55.280 --> 29:57.280
Thanks. We couldn't have done it without you.

371
29:57.360 --> 29:59.720
You gathered all these photos and even put this video together.

372
30:00.320 --> 30:02.680
We've known each other for ages. It's the least I could do.

373
30:03.280 --> 30:06.040
Right, about that thing I mentioned last time…

374
30:07.000 --> 30:07.880
No problem.

375
30:07.960 --> 30:10.200
It'll help make our event more interesting.

376
30:11.360 --> 30:13.200
-You should check everything again. -Okay.

377
30:13.760 --> 30:15.040
How did this balloon get in here?

378
30:16.360 --> 30:17.720
Carry on. I'll take it outside.

379
30:17.800 --> 30:19.600
-Okay, bye. -Bye.

380
30:35.120 --> 30:36.800
Didn't we agree to go together?

381
30:36.880 --> 30:38.640
I'm going to be late because I'm waiting for you.

382
30:38.720 --> 30:40.600
I know exactly what you're up to.

383
30:40.680 --> 30:42.560
You pretend to invite me to the exhibition,

384
30:42.640 --> 30:45.400
but in reality, you want me to buy your group's specimens,

385
30:45.480 --> 30:47.760
preferably paying a high price for them.

386
30:47.840 --> 30:48.840
Unfortunately,

387
30:48.920 --> 30:51.160
the college assigned me something else to do today.

388
30:51.240 --> 30:52.280
I can act as a proxy buyer.

389
30:52.360 --> 30:54.880
You… Never mind, I'll do it.

390
30:54.960 --> 30:56.960
All right, I've got work to do. Bye.

391
30:57.040 --> 30:59.160
EXHIBITION &amp; CHARITY BAZAAR ENTRANCE

392
31:02.760 --> 31:04.720
If you've just arrived, please come over here first.

393
31:04.800 --> 31:07.120
-This is really well-made. -Let's go.

394
31:07.200 --> 31:09.720
-This one looks nice. -This one's so pretty.

395
31:11.520 --> 31:12.640
This one looks nice.

396
31:15.800 --> 31:17.040
Hello, everyone.

397
31:17.120 --> 31:20.320
Welcome to the "Getting Closer to Nature" exhibition,

398
31:20.400 --> 31:22.400
a specimen exhibition jointly hosted by

399
31:22.480 --> 31:25.560
the Charity Club and Qing Yi University's College of Life Sciences.

400
31:25.640 --> 31:27.120
Our charity bazaar will begin shortly.

401
31:27.200 --> 31:29.760
Please take your seats as soon as possible.

402
31:31.040 --> 31:32.080
Let's go.

403
31:32.160 --> 31:34.080
-Let's check that one out. -Sure.

404
31:34.160 --> 31:35.720
-Let's go. -Sure.

405
31:37.400 --> 31:40.360
All the specimens on display today

406
31:40.440 --> 31:44.520
were handmade by our junior-year Life Sciences students.

407
31:44.600 --> 31:46.760
Every piece is one-of-a-kind.

408
31:46.840 --> 31:50.400
All of these specimens will be available for purchase.

409
31:50.480 --> 31:52.240
As our Charity Club pledges,

410
31:52.320 --> 31:56.280
all proceeds from the sales will go entirely toward

411
31:56.360 --> 31:57.240
charitable causes.

412
31:59.400 --> 32:01.240
To make a purchase,

413
32:01.320 --> 32:05.040
scan the QR code on the screen to view detailed information

414
32:05.120 --> 32:07.320
about all the pieces on display.

415
32:07.400 --> 32:09.040
Choose a piece you're interested in,

416
32:09.120 --> 32:12.760
then enter online the maximum amount you're willing to pay.

417
32:12.840 --> 32:14.200
After the exhibition,

418
32:14.280 --> 32:18.480
we'll review the bids and select the highest bidder for each piece,

419
32:18.560 --> 32:20.280
then use the address provided

420
32:20.360 --> 32:23.880
to mail the piece or deliver it directly to the winner's dorm.

421
32:24.600 --> 32:26.480
-That's strange. -What's wrong?

422
32:27.560 --> 32:29.560
I saw Zheng Yu's specimen, and it looked really nice.

423
32:29.640 --> 32:31.200
So I tried to place a bid.

424
32:31.280 --> 32:33.160
It says it's already been sold.

425
32:33.240 --> 32:36.120
How is that possible? Isn't there supposed to be an auction?

426
32:36.200 --> 32:39.400
All right, that's everything I wanted to share with you.

427
32:39.480 --> 32:42.480
Our charity bazaar is now officially starting!

428
32:50.960 --> 32:53.320
I'd like to take a few more minutes of your time.

429
32:53.400 --> 32:56.480
We have another collection of special pieces.

430
32:56.560 --> 32:57.840
SPECIAL AUCTION PIECE

431
33:00.200 --> 33:01.520
Aren't those Zheng Yu's specimens?

432
33:04.200 --> 33:06.720
We have a classmate

433
33:06.800 --> 33:09.280
whose dad died when she was a child.

434
33:10.360 --> 33:12.960
Then, just before she reached adulthood, her mom was in a car accident

435
33:13.760 --> 33:15.200
and was left in a vegetative state.

436
33:15.760 --> 33:17.040
I remember

437
33:17.120 --> 33:18.840
the original purpose of this charity bazaar

438
33:18.920 --> 33:21.240
was to spread kindness through our work.

439
33:21.840 --> 33:23.400
That kindness

440
33:23.480 --> 33:25.080
has reached people far and wide,

441
33:25.160 --> 33:28.800
yet somehow it has never reached this particular classmate,

442
33:28.880 --> 33:30.880
even though she needs it so much.

443
33:33.960 --> 33:34.960
So

444
33:35.800 --> 33:38.480
I spoke with the charity bazaar organizers

445
33:38.560 --> 33:42.800
and selected this student's specimen for a special auction.

446
33:43.400 --> 33:45.520
Everyone is welcome to join the live bidding.

447
33:46.520 --> 33:48.480
This is the true meaning behind holding this event.

448
33:48.560 --> 33:49.680
I think so too.

449
33:54.040 --> 33:56.600
Here is an update on her mom's condition.

450
33:56.680 --> 33:58.400
I hope you'll show your support.

451
34:07.200 --> 34:08.440
Zheng Yu.

452
34:09.239 --> 34:10.600
As the person involved,

453
34:11.679 --> 34:13.560
would you like to come up and say a few words?

454
34:29.320 --> 34:32.880
Xie Yudi! Did you get her consent before doing all this?

455
34:32.960 --> 34:36.320
You discussed it with the Charity Club, but didn't even bother consulting her?!

456
34:36.400 --> 34:37.960
-Exactly! -Exactly!

457
34:38.040 --> 34:39.920
-How could he do that? -How could he?

458
34:40.000 --> 34:42.560
-Did you discuss it behind her back? -Right, did you?

459
34:42.639 --> 34:43.560
No, that's not…

460
34:43.639 --> 34:45.679
Well… This has nothing to do with us!

461
34:49.280 --> 34:52.480
Live bidding is now open. Who's willing to bid?

462
34:59.120 --> 35:00.840
I chose to do this,

463
35:01.600 --> 35:03.520
so I'm willing to accept any criticism.

464
35:04.440 --> 35:07.680
I believe that what's more important than these objections

465
35:08.360 --> 35:12.080
is to give Zheng Yu some actual help.

466
35:14.400 --> 35:15.720
I hope everyone here

467
35:16.720 --> 35:20.640
will show their support and join me in helping Zheng Yu.

468
35:32.280 --> 35:33.800
What's going on?

469
35:35.120 --> 35:37.360
Someone's getting beaten up!

470
35:59.440 --> 36:00.840
Stop fighting!

471
36:00.920 --> 36:02.040
Come on, stop fighting!

472
36:02.120 --> 36:03.760
-Chen Yanzhou! -Calm down!

473
36:03.840 --> 36:06.000
That's enough, Yanzhou! Stop!

474
36:14.880 --> 36:17.880
-Don't! Don't do it! -Stop fighting!

475
37:23.400 --> 37:26.360
We've just seen the college buildings and the lecture halls.

476
37:26.440 --> 37:28.880
This here is an exhibition hall.

477
37:28.960 --> 37:31.800
It's shared by several colleges.

478
37:31.880 --> 37:34.480
Whenever we need to hold an event or put on an exhibition,

479
37:34.560 --> 37:35.560
we usually use this space.

480
37:35.640 --> 37:36.680
Take a look.

481
37:37.320 --> 37:39.520
These are all made by our students.

482
37:40.040 --> 37:40.880
That's right.

483
37:40.960 --> 37:44.360
This charity bazaar is actually a traditional event held by our college.

484
37:44.440 --> 37:46.160
It just so happens to be taking place today,

485
37:46.240 --> 37:48.400
so we brought all the officials over to have a look.

486
37:50.400 --> 37:52.680
It certainly sounds lively.

487
37:53.520 --> 37:57.680
Our college has always taken an open-minded approach to our students.

488
37:57.760 --> 37:59.880
I don't care what others think.

489
37:59.960 --> 38:03.160
I've always believed that while you're young,

490
38:03.240 --> 38:04.480
you should make some waves.

491
38:04.560 --> 38:06.760
-Am I right? -Yes, absolutely!

492
38:06.840 --> 38:07.760
Just listen to that.

493
38:07.840 --> 38:10.560
That's what young people full of energy sound like.

494
38:10.640 --> 38:11.720
Exactly.

495
38:11.800 --> 38:13.160
Let's go inside and take a look.

496
38:13.240 --> 38:14.440
I'm looking forward to it.

497
38:14.520 --> 38:16.480
-Let's go. -All right, let's go.

498
38:16.560 --> 38:17.720
After you.

499
38:18.400 --> 38:20.920
Actually, our students' greatest strength

500
38:21.000 --> 38:23.680
is their hands-on skills.

501
38:31.880 --> 38:34.640
Everyone, stop! What are you doing?

502
38:39.240 --> 38:41.400
This is just a rehearsal…

503
38:48.920 --> 38:51.400
Xie Yudi has really screwed us over.

504
38:51.480 --> 38:53.920
Don't you think the name Xie Yudi sounds familiar?

505
38:55.160 --> 38:57.080
I think I heard some gossip about him recently.

506
38:57.160 --> 38:59.040
You mean the rumors that he bullied a classmate?

507
38:59.720 --> 39:01.120
I heard about that too.

508
39:01.200 --> 39:03.320
Do you think it's true?

509
39:03.400 --> 39:05.480
How could someone like that be at our university?

510
39:05.560 --> 39:06.640
You never know.

511
39:06.720 --> 39:09.320
I don't think these rumors came out of nowhere.

512
39:10.160 --> 39:12.240
Who do you think started these rumors?

513
39:13.720 --> 39:15.480
-I don't know. -No idea.

514
39:17.840 --> 39:20.160
Speak up. What happened?

515
39:22.800 --> 39:26.120
Dean. Chen Yanzhou was the one who threw the first punch.

516
39:28.000 --> 39:29.280
Dean.

517
39:29.360 --> 39:31.560
I know Chen Yanzhou fairly well.

518
39:31.640 --> 39:34.480
He's not the kind of student who hits people for no reason.

519
39:36.080 --> 39:38.960
Mr. Li, there were plenty of people watching what happened.

520
39:39.040 --> 39:42.720
You can't just smooth things over with a few words and call it a day.

521
39:46.080 --> 39:47.040
Chen Yanzhou.

522
39:48.200 --> 39:49.400
Do you have anything to say?

523
39:52.840 --> 39:53.800
Fine.

524
39:55.080 --> 39:56.640
There are security cameras in the hall.

525
39:56.720 --> 40:00.280
We'll find out what happened and who struck first

526
40:00.360 --> 40:01.600
by checking the footage.

527
40:01.680 --> 40:02.680
Dean…

528
40:03.480 --> 40:05.440
The exhibition hall uses old security cameras.

529
40:05.520 --> 40:07.000
They have no backup power,

530
40:07.080 --> 40:09.440
so the cameras went offline when the power was cut.

531
40:11.400 --> 40:14.600
Well, even if we don't have footage, there were plenty of students there!

532
40:14.680 --> 40:17.000
We still need to get to the bottom of what actually happened!

533
40:25.040 --> 40:25.880
Zheng Yu.

534
40:26.760 --> 40:30.080
I called you in to get a better understanding of what happened.

535
40:31.320 --> 40:33.720
Did you know beforehand about what happened

536
40:33.800 --> 40:35.680
at today's charity bazaar?

537
40:36.440 --> 40:37.640
What exactly do you mean?

538
40:38.640 --> 40:42.800
I mean Xie Yudi's fundraising for your mom.

539
40:44.840 --> 40:45.680
I didn't know.

540
40:47.320 --> 40:49.520
Then the photos he provided…

541
40:50.520 --> 40:51.920
I didn't take them.

542
40:52.000 --> 40:53.800
I also didn't know where he got them.

543
40:54.440 --> 40:55.840
I don't really understand.

544
40:55.920 --> 40:58.000
Isn't this a violation of my privacy?

545
41:00.200 --> 41:02.640
I think we shouldn't overcomplicate things.

546
41:03.360 --> 41:06.080
What if Xie Yudi was just trying to help?

547
41:06.160 --> 41:08.720
As I recall, you two get along well.

548
41:08.800 --> 41:11.680
During that exam incident, he even stepped in to explain things for you.

549
41:12.360 --> 41:14.920
Maybe this time, he was just trying to help you--

550
41:15.000 --> 41:15.840
Ma'am.

551
41:17.320 --> 41:19.880
What if there are people in this world

552
41:19.960 --> 41:21.680
who offer help to others

553
41:22.480 --> 41:24.000
only to turn everyone against them?

554
41:25.600 --> 41:26.840
Turn everyone against them?

555
41:28.200 --> 41:29.760
I… I don't quite understand.

556
41:32.880 --> 41:33.920
It's getting late.

557
41:34.000 --> 41:36.000
I have a tutoring job, so I'll be going.

558
41:38.680 --> 41:40.240
Turn everyone against them?

559
41:46.760 --> 41:49.080
DIRECTOR LIU

560
41:51.920 --> 41:52.760
Director Liu.

561
41:52.840 --> 41:54.440
Have you checked the Campus Forum?

562
41:54.520 --> 41:56.280
Do you know what it's like right now?

563
41:57.520 --> 41:59.320
I just spoke with Zheng Yu.

564
41:59.400 --> 42:02.680
She knew nothing about the fundraiser and strongly objected to it.

565
42:02.760 --> 42:05.520
I may need a little more time to look into this.

566
42:05.600 --> 42:09.160
Who said anything about Zheng Yu? It's that student, Xie Yudi!

567
42:09.960 --> 42:12.000
Everyone's saying he bullied a classmate.

568
42:12.080 --> 42:13.640
The rumors are spreading like wildfire!

569
42:14.520 --> 42:17.000
The city officials are here this week,

570
42:17.080 --> 42:20.760
and our college keeps getting dragged into one mess after another!

571
42:27.040 --> 42:29.280
Zhuang Ning, are you feeling any better?

572
42:30.280 --> 42:31.240
Much better.

573
42:31.320 --> 42:32.960
I just have a little cough left.

574
42:33.680 --> 42:35.120
That means you're almost better.

575
42:35.760 --> 42:36.960
When I get sick,

576
42:37.040 --> 42:39.160
a runny nose and a cough are the final stage.

577
42:39.240 --> 42:41.080
It means the battle's almost over.

578
42:42.960 --> 42:44.760
Has Zheng Yu come back to the dorm?

579
42:45.280 --> 42:48.080
Didn't she go to the charity bazaar?

580
42:48.160 --> 42:49.760
Haven't you seen her?

581
42:55.920 --> 42:57.240
Did something happen?

582
43:13.560 --> 43:16.080
You also keep putting up with Xie Yudi

583
43:16.680 --> 43:17.880
without saying a word.

584
43:19.200 --> 43:20.800
Why do you do that?

585
43:21.880 --> 43:23.400
I just don't get it.

586
43:23.480 --> 43:25.440
Why did the university ask Zheng Yu to explain?

587
43:25.520 --> 43:26.960
She's not the one who caused all this.

588
43:29.320 --> 43:32.360
It's already this late, and they still haven't let her come back.

589
43:32.440 --> 43:33.280
Exactly.

590
43:34.080 --> 43:35.440
I just don't understand.

591
43:35.520 --> 43:37.760
I mean, Xie Yudi is someone with a record.

592
43:37.840 --> 43:39.720
Shouldn't the university investigate him?

593
43:39.800 --> 43:42.000
I wish the person he bullied would come forward.

594
43:42.080 --> 43:43.560
He deserves a good beating!

595
43:45.320 --> 43:47.400
Weren't they originally high school classmates?

596
43:47.480 --> 43:49.320
It shouldn't be hard to find that person.

597
43:50.240 --> 43:51.440
But…

598
43:51.520 --> 43:52.800
It is not our place

599
43:52.880 --> 43:54.960
to tell those who have been hurt that they must be brave.

600
44:00.080 --> 44:03.240
Where did you hear about Xie Yudi's past?

601
44:03.320 --> 44:05.000
People have been talking privately.

602
44:05.640 --> 44:07.880
Especially today. Everything blew up after the fight.

603
44:07.960 --> 44:11.160
Zhuang Ning, it's obvious you don't really scroll through the Campus Forum.

604
44:11.240 --> 44:13.120
It's full of posts about Xie Yudi now.

605
44:19.280 --> 44:23.160
XIE YUDI

606
44:30.960 --> 44:32.640
BULLIES LIKE HIM SHOULD BE EXPELLED!

607
44:32.720 --> 44:34.600
IF YOU KNOW XIE YUDI, STEP FORWARD.

608
44:34.680 --> 44:37.000
DAD

609
45:01.360 --> 45:02.600
Have you stared long enough?

610
45:05.360 --> 45:06.240
What do you want?

611
45:19.120 --> 45:21.840
All that random stuff that suddenly surfaced these past two days…

612
45:23.640 --> 45:24.760
Did you post it?

613
45:31.160 --> 45:32.000
Forget it.

614
45:33.360 --> 45:34.800
It couldn't have been you.

615
45:37.640 --> 45:38.760
It doesn't matter.

616
45:39.960 --> 45:43.440
If you're called in and questioned about it, just behave yourself.

617
45:45.160 --> 45:46.160
Like old times.

618
45:48.640 --> 45:49.480
Got it?

619
45:50.960 --> 45:52.160
Got it.

620
46:29.160 --> 46:30.240
Hello, ma'am.

621
46:34.160 --> 46:35.880
You're Gao Xing's tutor, right?

622
46:37.280 --> 46:38.400
I just finished tutoring her.

623
46:39.320 --> 46:42.080
You fixed my phone last time, and I haven't thanked you yet.

624
46:42.160 --> 46:43.360
-Come in and sit down. -It's--

625
46:43.440 --> 46:45.120
I'll be right back after taking out the trash.

626
46:45.200 --> 46:49.480
It's fine. I was just passing by and wanted to say hello.

627
46:55.000 --> 46:56.440
You're here to see Yanzhou, aren't you?

628
46:58.800 --> 47:01.880
I'm sorry, but he went to see Yanan today to talk about studies.

629
47:01.960 --> 47:04.200
He decided to stay the night there just in case they talk late.

630
47:13.600 --> 47:16.200
Some people enjoy getting into fights,

631
47:16.280 --> 47:17.120
but once they're hurt,

632
47:17.200 --> 47:20.240
they're afraid their parents will find out and don't even dare go home.

633
47:28.720 --> 47:30.400
Just one can, okay? Don't make this a habit.

634
47:37.200 --> 47:39.160
An injured hand is no big deal.

635
47:39.240 --> 47:41.720
But if something happens to your heart, how will you do experiments?

636
47:42.320 --> 47:44.520
You'll just have to lie there and be the test subject.

637
47:46.400 --> 47:48.440
Come on, tell me. There's no one else around now.

638
47:54.600 --> 47:56.800
Why did you fight Xie Yudi?

639
47:56.880 --> 47:58.920
What happened that made fighting seem necessary?

640
48:00.800 --> 48:02.480
I did it because family is the bottom line.

641
48:05.280 --> 48:07.040
Once it sank in for her

642
48:07.120 --> 48:12.640
that as her mom's child, she did nothing at all in that situation,

643
48:14.080 --> 48:15.640
her heart would hurt.

644
48:16.800 --> 48:17.640
So…

645
48:19.640 --> 48:20.760
I did it for her.

646
48:40.120 --> 48:42.280
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

647
49:27.320 --> 49:28.480
RECENT

648
49:42.120 --> 49:45.000
CHEN YANZHOU

649
51:36.800 --> 51:39.080
What are you doing here?

650
51:42.840 --> 51:45.200
I was looking for a quiet place to study,

651
51:45.800 --> 51:46.800
and then I saw you.

652
51:50.480 --> 51:53.400
You haven't put medicine on your forehead yet, have you?

653
52:13.880 --> 52:16.080
Thank you for today.

654
52:18.920 --> 52:21.520
Ever since my mom got sick,

655
52:21.600 --> 52:23.640
I haven't really looked closely at her face.

656
52:24.600 --> 52:27.680
So at first, I didn't quite process it.

657
52:29.760 --> 52:31.600
You have classes and part-time work.

658
52:31.680 --> 52:33.080
You're busy.

659
52:33.160 --> 52:34.320
It's completely normal.

660
52:37.520 --> 52:38.960
I was afraid to look too closely,

661
52:40.000 --> 52:44.160
because if I did, I'd see how terribly thin she'd become,

662
52:44.240 --> 52:47.640
looking nothing like how she used to be.

663
52:50.760 --> 52:53.720
I was afraid that if I looked too closely,

664
52:54.480 --> 52:55.760
I'd be the one to break down.

665
52:59.600 --> 53:00.760
So

666
53:01.760 --> 53:04.280
thank you for putting a stop to it all.

667
53:13.720 --> 53:14.960
By the way,

668
53:15.040 --> 53:17.360
has the university given you any trouble?

669
53:18.680 --> 53:20.680
Don't worry. I'll be fine.

670
53:20.760 --> 53:21.880
That's good.

671
53:22.440 --> 53:24.400
Your mom said you weren't coming home tonight.

672
53:24.480 --> 53:26.920
I was worried something else might have happened to you.

673
53:28.120 --> 53:30.600
You went to my house looking for me?

674
53:33.240 --> 53:34.520
You helped me,

675
53:35.160 --> 53:36.880
so of course I wanted to thank you.

676
53:58.160 --> 53:59.480
Are you okay?

677
54:33.800 --> 54:35.480
I… I'm going to wash my hands.

678
57:53.200 --> 57:58.200
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
